<p><em><em>Saslow D, Boetes C, Burke W. et al. American Cancer Society Guidelines for Breast Screening with MRI as an Adjunct to Mammography. </em><a href="https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/15424863" title="CA: A Cancer Journal for Clinicians homepage"><em>CA: A Cancer Journal for Clinicians. 2009 Feb 19.  57(2).</em></a></em></p>

